message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HiOmicsFormer"
abstract: >-
  Code and results for "HiOmicsFormer revisited: normalisation artefacts in a public multi-omics
  benchmark explain apparent pan-cancer subtypes": a multi-omics transformer with deep embedded
  clustering, and the re-evaluation that traced its apparent pan-cancer clusters to inconsistent
  file scaling in the MLOmics benchmark.
